36PHP – File Inclusions 
The include() Function 
The require() Function 
The include and require statements are identical, except 
upon failure: 
-the require will produce a fatal error (E_COMPILE_ERROR) 
and stop the script 
- the include will only produce a warning (E_WARNING) and 
the script will continue. 

